# Underwater Vision Datasets
---

For the Chinese version of the README, please visit [readme.md](./README.md).

---
> This repository compiles publicly available datasets related to underwater vision, including image enhancement, image classification, object detection, semantic segmentation, instance segmentation, salient and camouflaged object detection, object tracking, and underwater 3D reconstruction tasks.
> 
> 🌟 If this helps your research, please give us a Star!
> 
> 📝 Corresponding paper: [A survey of underwater visual datasets for ocean intelligence]

